      "comment": "POWER REECE (4) was decisive at this track last start, putting 4.5L on her nearest rival, who's since come out and won well, while also confirming her liking for the Poly. The 2kg claim adds further appeal. COASTAL COWBOY (3) is the clear danger after successive wins, the latest at this venue as favourite. Piesely sticking is a bonus. HUMANITY (1) was safely held in BM70 grade first-up, but he drops out of that race and returns to a distance range where his record reads well. EXPLOSIVE POWER (5) comes through lower-grade BM55 form, though his latest fifth had merit after interference and he profiles as a realistic minor hope with weight relief.  ARCHERS REIGN (7) is going better than his form reads and is a lightweight flyer.",
